title: "Decoupled Authentication for UAV Handover and Edge Service Migration Without Clock Synchronization"
abstract: >-
  Experimental source code for a decoupled, clock-synchronization-free
  authentication protocol for UAV communication handover and edge service
  migration: Tamarin models, C++ protocol core, ns-3/IoD-Sim simulations and
  cryptographic benchmarks.
